ommitted, with timeline).\n- Kuadrant installability on CKS with Istio is validated with pass/fail evidence (pods running,\n  AuthPolicy enforceable, TokenRateLimitPolicy enforceable).\n- The deployment mechanism for MaaS xKS is selected from the priority ladder with rationale.\n- If not committed: escalation to product leadership is recorded and the selected fallback\n  (standalone Authorino + Limitador, or direct Envoy ext_authz) is documented with its\n  implications for long-term support.\n\n## HLR Traceability\n\n- [P0] RHCL official xKS support status confirmed and deployment mechanism validated.\n- [P0] Token rate limiting functional on xKS (mechanism validation portion).\n"}}],"model":"rits/zai-org/glm-5-3","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":64348,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-90b1b6f56466ed62","agent_id":"a8a2b528182aa5e23","session_id":"d2b1376c-e550-4ef4-93a1-44e607f6014e","uuid":"6c407e53-8df0-4f97-a3af-16c0e30806e0","timestamp":"2026-10-22T08:59:39.382Z","subagent_type":"claude","task_description":"Decompose RHAISTRAT-8003"}
