D\n  references), not conjecture.\n- Explicit go/no-go on extending the Tenant CRD with `groupClaimPath`, selecting the conditional\n  implementation branch for group claim mapping (code change vs. documented claim format).\n- Recommended release vehicle (baseline change vs. post-3.4 patch vs. defer) for maas-api\n  observability instrumentation.\n- MaaS 3.4 build availability (RC and stable) confirmed with dates, or the timing risk escalated.\n\n## HLR Traceability\n\n- Enables [P0] External OIDC authentication validated for user identity.\n- Enables [P0] Configurable OIDC group claim path mapping.\n- Enables [P0] Observability metrics functional.\n"}}],"model":"rits/zai-org/glm-5-3","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":64348,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-90b1b6f56466ed62","agent_id":"a8a2b528182aa5e23","session_id":"d2b1376c-e550-4ef4-93a1-44e607f6014e","uuid":"d240f4b7-21b2-4c06-8f94-3c4e0ef0da24","timestamp":"2026-10-22T08:59:49.074Z","subagent_type":"claude","task_description":"Decompose RHAISTRAT-8003"}
