or MaaS metrics\n51\t  endpoints).\n52\t- Loki aggregation of MaaS structured logs with usable label filters.\n53\t- Collaboration with the xKS Platform team on the CKS observability integration.\n54\t\n55\t## Acceptance Criteria\n56\t\n57\t- Given a deployed MaaS instance on CKS with Perses dashboards installed, when an admin navigates\n58\t  to the MaaS observability dashboard, then the dashboard displays token usage per subscription,\n59\t  rate limiting enforcement events, and API key lifecycle metrics over the last 24 hours,\n60\t  measured by dashboard rendering with live data.\n61\t- MaaS metrics are queryable from the CKS Prometheus instance.\n62\t- MaaS structured logs are queryable in CKS Grafana Loki with label filters.\n63\t\n64\t## HLR Traceability\n65\t\n66\t- [P0] Observability metrics functional (dashboards and Prometheus integration portion).\n67\t- [P1] Observability logging functional (Loki aggregation portion).\n68\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-a28edd69652dfb8f","agent_id":"aa81afe1864591cbd","session_id":"d2b1376c-e550-4ef4-93a1-44e607f6014e","uuid":"604d690e-3dd3-4f84-8f7a-49a228ff47b4","timestamp":"2026-10-22T09:05:29.660Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-bd46418f9ee2ea31","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"claude","task_description":"Review RHAISTRAT-8003 decomposition"}
