\n- Hand the findings to the known-limitations documentation effort.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- Failure mode — OIDC provider unavailable: API key requests continue to succeed; OIDC requests\n  fail with HTTP 503 and a descriptive error, measured by response status and error body.\n- Failure mode — Limitador pod terminated: inference requests denied with HTTP 503, measured by\n  response status and Envoy logs showing upstream connection failure.\n- Failure mode — cert-manager TLS rotation: active inference requests continue without\n  interruption; new requests succeed with the new certificate, measured by zero connection errors\n  during the rotation window and successful TLS handshake validation post-rotation.\n- Failure mode — PostgreSQL unavailable: API key creation fails with HTTP 503 and existing API\n  key validation fails on cache miss, while OIDC token-based authentication continues to succeed,\n  measured by response status and error logs.\n- What works, what breaks, and the engineering delta are documented for both platforms.\n\n## HLR Traceability\n\n- [P0] MaaS successfully deployed on CKS (failure-mode validation portion).\n- [P0] MaaS successfully deployed on AKS (failure-mode validation portion).\n- Enables [P1] Known limitations documented (engineering-delta findings feed the documentation).\n"}}],"model":"rits/zai-org/glm-5-3","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":52391,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-a57964090eceb0b5","agent_id":"a4a6b6390e6cbdd43","session_id":"d2b1376c-e550-4ef4-93a1-44e607f6014e","uuid":"a0e59291-2f92-44b8-8ba1-d4506528148a","timestamp":"2026-10-22T09:16:59.575Z","subagent_type":"claude","task_description":"Revise RHAISTRAT-8003 decomposition"}
